[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27905.91, "timestamp": "07:45:05", "text": "嗯，也許你是對的。  看來我得繼續努力了。我指望你了。你好。呃，我們來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27916.4, "timestamp": "07:45:16", "text": "存錢。把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27924.67, "timestamp": "07:45:24", "text": "[音樂]保存到這裡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27929.948, "timestamp": "07:45:29", "text": "哦，等等。您可以節省九頁。哇，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27933.548, "timestamp": "07:45:33", "text": "太棒了。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27940.99, "timestamp": "07:45:40", "text": "意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27957.948, "timestamp": "07:45:57", "text": "你知道嗎"}]